            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kotema EJAKAIT Musa atiar, “Kodoku moru mama ajai, kiboi kaŋina: kainakini jo amor nuewadikat, ka ikisila ka aicorakineta, tetere isisianakini kes.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
