        {
          "text": "Kotema ŋesi imakio atiar, “Kidareunai sio kane, aitodol nekibonunio mama ijaas; ido koany, Aaron ka Kur ejaas nepepe kayes; ninitunanan yeneiai akirot, kolot mama ejaas.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
